  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development fails to overcome the previous first\r\nreason for refusal (ref. 23/P3290). By reason of its scale, massing and design,\r\nthe first floor side extension, when combined with the roof extensions, would\r\nfail to appear subordinate, and the discordant roof form would result in a\r\npoorly integrated addition. The proposal would therefore fail to achieve a high\r\nquality design, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the host\r\ndwelling and wider streetscene, contrary to London Plan 2021 Policy D3 and\r\nMerton Local Plan 2024 Policies D12.1, D12.2, D12.3 and D12.4.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
